# Counter-example: an observation about a reading with no gmeow:vantage
# (fires lang:UngroundedReadingClaim / shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent).

@prefix lang:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ex:    <http://example.org/lang/> .

ex:english a lang:SignSystem .
ex:form a lang:WordForm ; lang:inSignSystem ex:english .
ex:r a lang:Reading ; lang:readingOf ex:form .

ex:obs a gmeow:Observation ;
    lang:aboutReading ex:r .
